.docs/decisions/0076-brand-identity.md:31:This framing captures the product's core promise without nostalgia for its own sake. It says: computing lost something important in the transition to cloud/SaaS, and AI-native local-first design gets it back. Not a return to the past — a synthesis of what the personal computer got right (ownership, directness, privacy) with what AI makes newly possible (intelligence, automation, synthesis).
