   225	Every maintenance ability declares its blast radius. Invocation pathways check blast radius against invoker privilege:
   226	
   227	| Blast radius | Who can invoke | Confirmation UX |
   228	|--------------|----------------|-----------------|
   229	| `single_entity` | System, User (with entity ownership) | None |
   230	| `entity_class` | System | None |

